PROVENANCE "A standalone practice choice commits only its first complete answer. The existing scorer supplies status. Dependent answers wait, pending manual and final items stay, and only settled answers with another question auto advance."
EXAMPLES disposition
  id | mode | preferenceEnabled | event | explicitCheckRequired | validTarget | answerComplete | alreadyCommitted | dependenciesReady | gradeStatus | hasNextQuestion -> expected
  first-wrong | practice | true | choice | false | true | true | false | true | wrong | true -> commit_show_advance
  first-correct | practice | true | choice | false | true | true | false | true | confirmed_full | true -> commit_show_advance
  final-wrong | practice | true | choice | false | true | true | false | true | wrong | false -> commit_show_stay
  pending-manual | practice | true | choice | false | true | true | false | true | pending_manual | true -> commit_show_stay
  unavailable | practice | true | choice | false | true | true | false | true | none | true -> commit_deferred
  dependent | practice | true | choice | false | true | true | false | false | none | true -> commit_deferred
  repeat-choice | practice | true | choice | false | true | true | true | true | wrong | true -> ignore
  timed | timed | true | choice | false | true | true | false | true | wrong | true -> editable
  preference-off | practice | false | choice | false | true | true | false | true | wrong | true -> editable
  unknown-target | practice | true | choice | false | false | true | false | false | none | true -> editable
  incomplete | practice | true | choice | false | true | false | false | true | none | true -> editable
  text-draft | practice | true | choice | true | true | true | false | true | wrong | true -> editable
  text-check | practice | true | check | true | true | true | false | true | wrong | true -> commit_show_advance
  empty-check | practice | true | check | true | true | false | false | true | none | true -> editable
END
